{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Returns observed occurrences of caller-supplied byte patterns in one local file. Each match carries its pattern_id, file_offset with the containing executable section and virtual_address when the file is a recognized ELF/PE/Mach-O image (both null otherwise), matched length, and preview_hex of up to the first 32 matched bytes, plus match_coverage and per_pattern_counts that record per-pattern and global truncation. Patterns are hex (bytes, ?? / A? / ?0 nibble wildcards, [n] / [n-m] / [n-] jumps, (aa|bb) alternation), literal text (ASCII and/or UTF-16LE, optional case-insensitive), or a JavaScript regular expression without backreferences; overlapping occurrences are reported. It does NOT extract, decode, unpack, interpret matches semantically, assess reachability, or judge intent. It reads the file once (<=256 MiB) without executing the target, without network access, and without writing files; regex and jump work is bounded, and patterns that are malformed or exceed the jump bound are rejected with a typed input error. Absent section context is reported as null, never omitted.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"examples":[{"path":"/artifacts/application","patterns":[{"id":"mz","type":"hex","value":"4D 5A"},{"id":"elf","type":"hex","value":"7F 45 4C 46"}]},{"max_matches":1000,"path":"/artifacts/application","patterns":[{"id":"url","type":"regex","value":"https?://[\\w./-]+"},{"id":"marker","type":"text","value":"Mozilla","wide":true}]}],"properties":{"max_matches":{"default":500,"description":"Maximum matches returned in total and scanned per pattern before truncation","maximum":10000,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"Absolute filesystem path to the selected local file","minLength":1,"pattern":"^[^\\x00]*$","type":"string"},"patterns":{"description":"Patterns to